<title>USA: ViroGroup names Charles Higgins Jr CEO.</title>
<headline>ViroGroup names Charles Higgins Jr CEO.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE CORAL, Fla. 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>ViroGroup Inc said on Friday that it has appointed Charles Higgins Jr as chairman, president and chief executive officer of the environmental enginering and consulting firm.</p>
<p>Higgins replaces Sylvester Ogden, who held these positions since joining the company two years ago, ViroGroup said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212 895-1610))</p>
</text>
